From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Berlin <dberlin@dberlin.org>
Date: Sat, 11 Nov 2023 21:28:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] [brcmfmac] Clean up and common interface creation handling

This makes firmware-side interface creation structures private
to interface creation, and commons out how creation is handled

Signed-off-by: Daniel Berlin <dberlin@dberlin.org>
(cherry picked from commit 3ead22a2aee29f30a804e23870c2cafa0a995b39)

Original-Commit: 640fa5195b9db6c1cb90fc5190a5d9ffce599cd7
Signed-off-by: Cody Ho <codyho@stanford.edu>
Assisted-By: LLM
